cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this course, please cite it as below."
title: "Statistics, by seeing it happen"
abstract: >-
  A self-paced, simulation-first probability and statistics course delivered as
  interactive Python notebooks, where almost every idea is demonstrated on real
  data rather than asserted. Includes an in-browser (JupyterLite) live-code layer
  and interactive explorables. Bundled datasets retain their own licenses.
type: software
